              "short": "$57.86\\,\\text{cm}^2$",
              "worked": "$\\begin{align*}A_1&=12\\times6\\\\A_1&=72\\,\\text{cm}^2\\\\A_2&=\\frac12\\pi(3)^2\\\\A_2&=\\frac{9\\pi}{2}\\,\\text{cm}^2\\\\A_{\\text{Total}}&=72-\\frac{9\\pi}{2}\\\\A_{\\text{Total}}&\\approx57.86\\,\\text{cm}^2\\end{align*}$",
